tion itself, not of serving Kairo; production cost is the serving cost the call weighs."}, {"what": "Strata under about ten cases (multi, next up, assistant shape and the rest)", "why": "Too small to read; their large gaps carry intervals that cross zero. The full tables hold them."}, {"what": "Items delivered, tool provider faults and turns that ran over budget", "why": "Describe the run's mechanics and do not bear on the call."}, {"what": "Latency", "why": "Read while other runs executed beside it, so it is not comparable between arms."}], "next": [{"text": "Re-price {arm:qwen3.8-flash} and {arm:1017} with each arm's provider routing recorded, and reconcile with the earlier round's cost finding.", "settles": "Whether the cost uplift belongs to the routing or the models; only a candidate cheaper than {arm:September} reopens the choice, and then on character alone, where {arm:qwen3.8-flash} is clearly worse."}, {"text": "Calibrate the judge against human ratings of character, drawing heavily on off-lane conversations.", "settles": "Whether the persona holds character gaps and the off-lane weakness are real or the judge's taste; it turns the judge caveat into evidence either way."}, {"text": "Write an off-lane directive for {arm:September} and rerun the off-lane stratum.", "settles": "Whether the large stratum where every model loses most can lift on the model being kept."}, {"text": "Only if {arm:1017} stays of interest: rerun it at a reasoning share matched to {arm:September}'s with {settle.passed.character adherence (v2).1017.September.cases_needed_80|int} cases per arm.", "settles": "Whether its pass-rate drop of {settle.passed.character adherence (v2).1017.September.difference|abs|pts} points is real and belongs to the model, four times in five."}], "method": [{"term": "Cases and repeats", "text": "{cases} conversations, each run {repeats} times per arm on the character adherence (v2) aspect, run on {meta.run_date}."}, {"term": "What pass means", "text": "A tria